text.section:
The Secretary shall develop guidance and criteria to be used in awarding grants under the Program, and an annual grant application, which shall include, at a minimum, requirements for the grantee to:

Report expenditures each quarter;


Retain all invoices, bills, receipts, canceled checks, proof of payment, and similar documentation to substantiate expenditures of grant funding;


Provide a 50 percent cash match from nonstate funds; and


Return excess state grant funding within 30 days after the term of the grant expires.
